    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Amends spec 004's seam with a per-adapter capability declaration beside the closed six-token vocabulary: the facts admission, qualification and the witness path currently learn by naming the one adapter (a stream it can witness, hooks it honours in print mode, a wire sidecar it can route through, a per-run configuration directory). Every branch reads the declaration. A test adapter with a different declaration proves the seam. No second provider is added.\n",
    "title": "Admission and qualification read what an adapter declares it can do, never which adapter it is"
  },
